<title>USA: Landstar System Inc Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Landstar System Inc Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SHELTON, Conn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						   Thirteen Weeks Ended</p>
<p>				     Mar 29, 1997	  Mar 30, 1996</p>
<p> Revenue				 $305,558		$295,477</p>
<p> Net income			    3,005(a)		   3,154</p>
<p> Net income per share		 0.24(a)		    0.25</p>
<p> Average shares		    12,726,000	    12,779,000</p>
<p>(a)  Includes $1,179,000 of restructuring costs, which after</p>
<p>deducting related income tax benefits of $495,000, reduced net</p>
<p>income by $684,000, or 5 cents per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
